    description: "Full-suite runs 6118, 6131, 6149 (first cron after the gate landed in aab55e9178 on 11-06): 'NOT CHECKED: variant install-rust-analyzer did not run to completion' and the same for add-extras, so check-allowlist-commands --trace exits 1 although every entry's commands match. Cause: rust_analyzer_install.install_rust_analyzer returns False before its (stubbed) subprocess call when shutil.which('rustup') is None; run_trace stands in rust-analyzer, gitleaks and sentence_transformers but not rustup. Live repro: the two variants exit 0 locally with ~/.cargo/bin on PATH and exit 1 (HG_TRACE_RC=1, 'Error: rustup is not on PATH') with it removed. Also means --stand-ins, which claims to reproduce the cron's view, passes on any machine with rustup. Fix shape: add rustup to the stand-in set (HG_TRACE_STUB already fakes subprocess.run), or patch the which in the variant. Consequence: the full-suite cron is red on this step every run."  # 509b
    fields: {}  # 509b
