  message: "Fixed in PR #2101: a rustup stand-in (STAND_IN_TOOLS / _missing_tools in scripts/check-allowlist-commands), and a structural test holding the stand-in set to every tool hypergumbo-core probes with shutil.which / resolve (git excepted, the runner image ships it). Live repro, the cron's command `scripts/check-allowlist-commands --trace` with ~/.cargo/bin off PATH (no rustup): before, install-rust-analyzer and add-extras exited 1 (HG_TRACE_RC=1, 'Error: rustup is not on PATH') and were NOT CHECKED; after, 'stand-ins used for: rust-analyzer, rustup' and neither is listed. Locally survey-scip and any-backend-scip were NOT CHECKED because scip-python is not installed on this machine; the CI step npm-installs it and run 6149 listed neither. The cron itself has not run on it yet."  # 262d
